        <mxCell id="physical-review-notes" parent="bUVAuwb-jT9W5OZjnAOs-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;spacing=10;" value="Physical cabling • Updated 2026-09-05&lt;br&gt;Speeds describe link/interface capacity, not measured throughput. Coax and bookshelf branch VLANs are not yet confirmed.&lt;br&gt;Sefer’s two NICs attach to separate Proxmox bridges. Same-LAN traffic on the TL-SX105 stays on the switch; router paths use 1GbE ports.&lt;br&gt;Neutral repeater cards identify other named locations. Wireless mesh uplink peers are not specified." vertex="1">
